<title>USA: Urban Outfitters Dec same-stores sales fall.</title>
<headline>Urban Outfitters Dec same-stores sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		     1996	 1995	Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$18.6	$16.9     +10.0    -12.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $146.4     $125.0     +17.0     +2.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Full company name is   Urban Outfitters Inc.</p>
<p>Note: Urban Outfitters said it expects that fourth quarter earnings will be below plan and possibly below last year's level.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
